category: Libs
requires: libvxlog1 pkg-config
sdesc: "C++ logging library (development)"
ldesc: "vxlog is a C++ library for writing messages to log files. Its main feature is
a printf-like syntax. Messages can be output to file, the console, and using
syslog. Output messages and journal modules can be filtered. The library is
thread-safe."
external-source: vxlog

